H`, or `stop` returns the sequence to step 0 and closes both valves. `stop` overrides all other conditions.\n- **Settling:** the hold timer is cleared outside regulation or whenever \\(|e|>\\varepsilon\\), so time from an earlier episode cannot satisfy a later episode\u2019s hold requirement.",
